    serial[0] must be '2' (0x32)
    serial[1] can be any char from charset
    serial[2] must equal chr(0x9D - (ord(serial[1]) - 0x24)) = chr(0xC1 - ord(serial[1]))
    and serial[2] must also be in the charset.
