    Algorithm:
      1. Compute MD5(name) -> 16 bytes
      2. Convert MD5 bytes to big integer X (little-endian, base 256)
      3. Compute R = X^D mod N  (where D and N are the hardcoded big numbers)
      4. Output R as uppercase hex string
